// M5-A3P-1003. Ch18 §5 heirloom errands (one per hero, each tied to someone they lost; SPEC §6.6;
// ~80 words each). Design and Progression own the rewards; Narrative owns the person. One node per hero; the flow
// plays each at its place. Every heirloom is held light-free: an object, not a binding.
title: ch18_heirloom_rhen
location: ch17/hollowmere
---
// Hollowmere, the hull's tool rack (Ch17 B04): Dace's diving hooks, re-edged.
@anim rhen pick_up diving_hooks
Rhen [neutral]: Same nick in the left one. #line:ch18_heir_001
<<if $ch17_first_berth>>
    Aldous_varrow as "Dock-master" [neutral]: Put an edge on them. He never did. #line:ch18_heir_002
<<endif>>
<<set $ch18_heirloom_rhen = true>>
===
title: ch18_heirloom_asha
---
// Haluna, the Velamir house: Imra's lantern-staff.
Neme [tender]: Your mother left this with me. She said you'd need a longer one. #line:ch18_heir_003
Asha [grief]: She was right. #line:ch18_heir_004
<<set $ch18_heirloom_asha = true>>
===
title: ch18_heirloom_toma
---
// Corrow, the armoury the watch reopened: Ivo's boarding spear.
Marra [neutral]: Ivo's. The watch kept it. They want you to have it. #line:ch18_heir_005
Toma [sad]: He'd have said it was too heavy for me. #line:ch18_heir_006
<<set $ch18_heirloom_toma = true>>
===
title: ch18_heirloom_ysolde
---
// Ansedra, by courier (she can't land): Corran's recipe book, bound as her folding book.
Ysolde [neutral]: Corran's recipes. He was a terrible cook. #line:ch18_heir_007
@wait 2.0
Ysolde [tender]: He wrote them all down anyway. In case one came out. #line:ch18_heir_008
<<set $ch18_heirloom_ysolde = true>>
===
title: ch18_heirloom_liss
---
// Hollowmere: a launcher built from Tobin's tide-wheel drawings.
Liss [neutral]: Tobin drew this when he was twelve. It never worked. #line:ch18_heir_009
Liss [soft_smile]: It works now. #line:ch18_heir_010
<<set $ch18_heirloom_liss = true>>
===
title: ch18_heirloom_kerrid
---
// Corrow, the stair foot: the stair-watch's anchor. Kerrid lands for this one only.
@mark kerrid stair_foot walk
@wait 3.0
Kerrid [neutral]: Watch's anchor. We set it every season. #line:ch18_heir_011
@anim kerrid lift stair_anchor
Kerrid [neutral]: Heavier than I remember. #line:ch18_heir_012
<<set $ch18_heirloom_kerrid = true>>
===
title: ch18_heirloom_pell
---
// Reedhollow: Ressa's reed-spear, given by Owa. Needs ch18_pell_named (the flow gates it).
Owa as "The eldest" [neutral]: Ressa's. We kept it with her name. Now you have yours, take hers. #line:ch18_heir_013
Pell [tender]: I will carry it the right way round. #line:ch18_heir_014
<<set $ch18_heirloom_pell = true>>
===
